  "notes": "The école fondamentale takes children from six (Loi n°1/19 of 2013) for nine years in four cycles and ends with the national certification and orientation exam for post-fondamental. General post-fondamental lasts three years (1ère–3ème année PF) and ends with the examen d'État; the teacher-training track lasts four years and technical tracks three or four. In June 2026 the government announced a 10th fondamental year from 2027/28; how later years will change is not yet published. Kirundi year names are not confirmed."
